---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Enroll — Finding the Right Words Practice Program" description="Enroll in the Finding the Right Words Practice Program.">
  <div class="page">
    <div class="wrap">

      <div class="page-head">
        <span class="eyebrow">Enroll</span>
        <h1>Start the Practice Program</h1>
        <p class="sub">The Field Guide maps the framework. The Practice Program trains your brain to use it, at the moment it counts.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="card">
        <p class="plan">Full Access</p>
        <p class="pitch">144 of the moments when it’s your turn to speak. You choose what to say, then see the reasoning behind every option: why the best one moves the session forward, and why the near misses miss.</p>
        <p class="amt">$<span>129</span> <small>one time</small></p>
        <p class="terms">Lifetime access to the entire program. No subscription.</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Three tiers, each emphasizing different skills</li>
          <li>All 144 clinical choice points, across 140 presenting issues</li>
          <li>The reasoning behind all 528 options</li>
          <li>The Practice Profile: tracks how your choices land and your own tendencies</li>
          <li>The option to write your own phrase before seeing the choices, ideal for a second round</li>
          <li>Reflection questions and a printable Practice Record</li>
          <li>Free updates as the program evolves</li>
          <li>Eligible for 6 CE hours through ACEP (optional, with a $39 fee paid to ACEP when you take the post-test)</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="guarantee">
        <div class="seal">✓</div>
        <div>
          <h2>14-day guarantee</h2>
          <p>If the Practice Program isn’t right for you, <a href="mailto:support@edenmethod.com">email us</a> within 14 days of purchase for a full refund. No questions asked.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Checkout → Ashley's GHL order form (hi.edenmethod.com/tapping-order). Access granted via Zapier→Supabase; see CHECKOUT-WIRING.md -->
      <div class="checkout" id="checkout">
        <a class="co-btn" href="https://hi.edenmethod.com/tapping-order">Enroll &middot; $129</a>
        <p class="co-sub">Secure checkout &middot; instant access &middot; 14-day guarantee</p>
      </div>

      <div class="next">
        <h2>What Happens Next</h2>
        <ol>
          <li><b>Check your email.</b> A welcome message with your access link is on its way. Open it, enter your purchase email, and you’re in.</li>
          <li><b>Start with Tier One, Sensing the Direction.</b> It sets the baseline for your Practice Profile. The first pass through each tier takes about an hour.</li>
          <li><b>Work at your own pace.</b> Progress is saved as long as you use the same computer and browser, so you can stop and return whenever.</li>
          <li><b>Come back anytime.</b> Access is permanent. Use it as a refresher before a difficult case, or whenever you want to keep your skills fresh.</li>
          <li><b>Earn CE credit if you wish.</b> When you finish, the Program links you to ACEP’s CE site for the post-test and your certificate. <a href="/#ce">How CE credit works</a></li>
        </ol>
      </div>

      <div class="quote">
        <blockquote>&ldquo;What David Feinstein has built is the thing almost no practitioner ever gets: focused, systematic practice on the words themselves, at the exact moments they matter. . . . This will quietly raise the level of anyone who works through it.&rdquo;</blockquote>
        <p class="attrib"><b>Nick Ortner</b> · Founder, The Tapping Solution</p>
        <blockquote style="margin-top:1.6rem">&ldquo;I am so impressed with Finding the Right Words. This is a fantastic way to quickly build skills with composite cases that accurately reflect client care. Your patients will benefit as your skills and confidence grow.&rdquo;</blockquote>
        <p class="attrib"><b>Kerri Husman, MD</b> · President of the Board, Association for Comprehensive Energy Psychology</p>
        <blockquote style="margin-top:1.6rem">&ldquo;A masterful presentation, indispensable for anyone wishing to master the art of skillful languaging in tapping therapies. Goes far beyond what is taught in traditional Energy Psychology trainings. I particularly appreciated the succinct &lsquo;Takeaways&rsquo; and the commentaries on my personal scores. Very highly recommended.&rdquo;</blockquote>
        <p class="attrib"><b>John Freedom</b> · Chair, Research Committee, Association for Comprehensive Energy Psychology</p>
      </div>

      <p class="help">Questions before you enroll? Email <a href="mailto:support@edenmethod.com">support@edenmethod.com</a>.</p>

      <div class="back">
        <a href="/">← Back to the program details</a>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>

  <style>
    .page{padding:3.6rem 0 2rem}
    .wrap{max-width:720px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 1.5rem}
    .page :where(h1,h2,h3,p,ul,ol,blockquote){margin:0}
    h1,h2,h3{font-family:var(--serif);font-weight:500;line-height:1.15;letter-spacing:-.01em;color:var(--navy)}
    .eyebrow{font-family:var(--ui);font-weight:700;font-size:.82rem;letter-spacing:.2em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--brass-deep)}

    .page-head{text-align:center;margin-bottom:2.4rem}
    .page-head .eyebrow{margin-bottom:1rem;display:block}
    .page-head h1{font-size:clamp(2.1rem,5vw,2.9rem);margin-bottom:.8rem}
    .page-head .sub{font-family:var(--serif);font-style:italic;font-size:1.1rem;color:var(--ink-soft);max-width:32rem;margin:0 auto}

    .card{background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;padding:2rem;margin-bottom:1.4rem}
    .card .plan{font-family:var(--ui);font-weight:700;font-size:.78rem;letter-spacing:.16em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--brass-deep);margin-bottom:.7rem}
    .card .pitch{color:var(--ink-soft);font-size:1rem;margin:0 0 1.1rem}
    .card .amt{font-family:var(--serif);font-size:2.8rem;color:var(--navy);line-height:1;display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:0}
    .card .amt small{margin-left:.5rem;font-size:.92rem;color:var(--ink-faint);font-family:var(--ui);font-weight:400}
    .card .terms{color:var(--ink-soft);margin:.55rem 0 1.2rem;font-size:.98rem}
    .card ul{list-style:none;padding:0;margin:0}
    .card li{padding:.42rem 0 .42rem 1.7rem;position:relative;font-size:.98rem}
    .card li::before{content:"✓";position:absolute;left:0;color:var(--brand);font-weight:700}

    .guarantee{display:flex;gap:1rem;align-items:flex-start;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(216,197,140,.16),rgba(216,197,140,.06));border:1px solid rgba(183,151,90,.4);border-radius:14px;padding:1.3rem 1.5rem;margin-bottom:1.4rem}
    .guarantee .seal{flex:0 0 2.6rem;height:2.6rem;border-radius:50%;background:var(--navy);color:var(--brass);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-weight:700;font-size:1.1rem}
    .guarantee h2{font-size:1.25rem;margin-bottom:.25rem}
    .guarantee p{color:var(--ink-soft);font-size:.98rem;margin:0}

    .placeholder{background:transparent;border:2px dashed rgba(151,143,131,.45);border-radius:14px;padding:2rem;text-align:center;margin-bottom:1rem}
    .placeholder .ph-label{font-family:var(--ui);font-weight:700;font-size:.72rem;letter-spacing:.18em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--ink-faint);margin-bottom:.9rem}
    .placeholder h3{font-size:1.15rem;color:var(--ink-soft);font-weight:500;margin-bottom:.4rem}
    .placeholder .ph-desc{font-size:.9rem;color:var(--ink-faint);margin-top:.2rem}
    .placeholder .ph-fields{display:grid;gap:.55rem;margin:1.3rem auto 0;max-width:22rem}
    .placeholder .ph-fields > div{height:2.3rem;background:rgba(151,143,131,.13);border-radius:6px}
    .placeholder .ph-fields .row{display:flex;gap:.55rem;background:transparent;height:auto}
    .placeholder .ph-fields .row > div{flex:1;height:2.3rem;background:rgba(151,143,131,.13);border-radius:6px}
    .placeholder .optin{display:flex;gap:.6rem;align-items:flex-start;text-align:left;max-width:22rem;margin:1.1rem auto 0;font-size:.88rem;line-height:1.45;color:var(--ink-soft);cursor:pointer}
    .placeholder .optin input{margin-top:.2rem;flex:0 0 auto;width:1rem;height:1rem;accent-color:var(--brand)}
    .placeholder .ph-pay{max-width:22rem;margin:1rem auto 0;height:2.6rem;border-radius:8px;background:rgba(23,108,155,.18);color:var(--ink-faint);font-weight:600;font-size:.92rem;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center}
    .checkout{background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;padding:2rem 1.5rem;text-align:center;margin-bottom:1rem}
    .checkout .co-btn{display:inline-block;text-decoration:none;font-family:var(--ui);font-weight:700;font-size:1.1rem;background:var(--navy);color:#fff;padding:1rem 2.4rem;border-radius:10px;transition:background .15s,transform .15s}
    .checkout .co-btn:hover{background:#17304a;transform:translateY(-1px);color:#fff}
    .checkout .co-sub{font-size:.9rem;color:var(--ink-faint);margin:1rem 0 0}
    .secure{text-align:center;font-size:.86rem;color:var(--ink-faint);margin:0 0 2.6rem}

    .next h2{font-size:1.45rem;margin-bottom:1rem;text-align:center}
    .next ol{list-style:none;padding:0;margin:0 0 2.6rem;display:grid;gap:.9rem;counter-reset:n}
    .next li{position:relative;padding:0 0 0 2.6rem;color:var(--ink-soft);font-size:.98rem;counter-increment:n}
    .next li::before{content:counter(n);position:absolute;left:0;top:.05rem;width:1.8rem;height:1.8rem;border-radius:50%;background:var(--navy);color:#fff;font-weight:700;font-size:.85rem;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center}
    .next li b{color:var(--ink)}

    .quote{border-top:1px solid var(--line);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);padding:2rem 0;margin-bottom:2.2rem;text-align:center}
    .quote blockquote{font-family:var(--serif);font-size:1.22rem;line-height:1.5;color:var(--navy);max-width:34rem;margin:0 auto}
    .quote .attrib{margin-top:.9rem;font-size:.9rem;color:var(--ink-faint)}
    .quote .attrib b{color:var(--ink);font-weight:600}

    .help{text-align:center;font-size:.95rem;color:var(--ink-soft)}
    .back{text-align:center;margin-top:1.6rem}
    .back a{color:var(--ink-soft);text-decoration:none;font-size:.92rem}
    .back a:hover{color:var(--brand)}

    @media(max-width:600px){
      .page{padding:2.4rem 0 1.4rem}
      .page-head{margin-bottom:1.8rem}
      .card,.placeholder{padding:1.5rem 1.3rem}
      .guarantee{padding:1.2rem 1.1rem}
    }
  </style>
</Base>
